---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About West Herts Kids" description="An independent local guide to children's activities in West Hertfordshire, run from Croxley Green.">
  <div class="container" style="padding-bottom:96px">
  <ol class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">/</li><li aria-current="page">About</li></ol>
  <header class="page-head"><p class="plate">About the guide</p><h1>About West Herts <em>Kids</em></h1></header>
  <div class="prose" style="margin-top:24px">
    
    <p>West Herts Kids is an independent guide to children's classes, clubs, holiday camps and days out in Watford, Rickmansworth, Croxley Green, Chorleywood, Abbots Langley and nearby.</p>
    <p>Finding what's on for kids locally usually means digging through Facebook groups, franchise websites and out-of-date listings. This site brings it together in one place, with ages, prices and timetables you can actually filter.</p>
    <h2>How listings work</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Listings are free for every provider.</li>
      <li>We build listings from public information and check them regularly. Providers can claim a listing to update it.</li>
      {SITE.mode === 'community'
        ? <li>There are no paid placements: the order is alphabetical, and nobody can pay to be higher up.</li>
        : <li>Featured listings are paid and always clearly labelled.</li>}
    </ul>
    <p>Spotted something wrong or missing? <a href="/list-your-activity/">Let us know</a>.</p>
  </div>
  </div>
</Base>
